    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2> In this world, you are the only man. A mysterious epidemic has struck, leaving all men but the protagonist dead.<br>Save humanity with a pregnancy harem. The battle does not end until every being in this world is pregnant.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819180/extras/659e4169c0241344f30e315bbc11bb91.poster.avif?t=1751245238\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819180/extras/659e4169c0241344f30e315bbc11bb91.webm?t=1751245238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819180/extras/659e4169c0241344f30e315bbc11bb91.mp4?t=1751245238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The protagonist, awakened from cryosleep, is guided by Nina from the Bits organization and asked to engage in sexual activities in a harem. To save humanity, the protagonist must impregnate many women; it is the only way left.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819180/extras/c53bdffa5a3a3e8b729c9ccb5017bb48.poster.avif?t=1751245238\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819180/extras/c53bdffa5a3a3e8b729c9ccb5017bb48.webm?t=1751245238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819180/extras/c53bdffa5a3a3e8b729c9ccb5017bb48.mp4?t=1751245238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The game is a simple clicker game, but the more you click, the more efficient the impregnation becomes.<br>For example, you can purchase a pregnancy factory to increase efficiency, or the protagonist can mutate into tentacles to impregnate on a large scale... There are plenty of variations to enjoy impregnating.<br>It comes with a simple touching feature; you can click on the females and enjoy their reactions. Rapid clicking increases the voltage gauge, and when the gauge reaches MAX, you can finish (ejaculate) and impregnate the female.<br><br>There are a total of 4 heroines. Each belongs to the human, elf, oni (demon), and dwarf races, and each one has two types of appearances prepared.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Clicker game<br></li><li>3D animated girls</li></ul>",
